{"2790340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elevator Experience", "steam_appid": 2790340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Embark on a one-of-a-kind journey of exploration in &quot;Elevator Experience&quot;. Step into the elevator and prepare to be transported to a world of mysteries, where every floor holds a new adventure waiting to be unlocked. With its dynamic gameplay and immersive environments, get ready for an experience like no other.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized Rooms</h2><li>Discover a myriad of themed rooms, each with its own set of mechanics and challenges to conquer. From futuristic laboratories to enchanted forests, every room offers a fresh experience and countless opportunities for adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/3e64ae1b28c7d78c46afdbfe0ec1ed40.poster.avif?t=1709490280\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/3e64ae1b28c7d78c46afdbfe0ec1ed40.webm?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/3e64ae1b28c7d78c46afdbfe0ec1ed40.mp4?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Atmosphere</h2></li><li>Immerse yourself in the captivating atmosphere of the rooms, brought to life through stunning visuals and atmospheric sound design.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/54c2a8399ca985a2bd84ea3bb5cdd705.poster.avif?t=1709490280\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/54c2a8399ca985a2bd84ea3bb5cdd705.webm?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/54c2a8399ca985a2bd84ea3bb5cdd705.mp4?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Mechanics</h2></li><li>Put your skills to the test with a variety of mechanics and challenges unique to each room. Whether you're deciphering ancient runes or navigating treacherous traps, &quot;Elevator Experience&quot; offers gameplay that is both engaging and rewarding.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/e20e4fe41592c4a511b1863951ed965a.poster.avif?t=1709490280\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/e20e4fe41592c4a511b1863951ed965a.webm?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790340/extras/e20e4fe41592c4a511b1863951ed965a.mp4?t=1709490280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><br>Prepare to embark on an extraordinary adventure filled with mystery, suspense, and endless surprises in &quot;Elevator Experience&quot;. Are you ready to unlock the secrets of the elevator? Step into the elevator and begin your journey into the unknown.", "about_the_game": "Embark on a one-of-a-kind journey of exploration in &quot;Elevator Experience&quot;. Step into the elevator and prepare to be transported to a world of mysteries, where every floor holds a new adventure waiting to be unlocked. With its dynamic gameplay and immersive environments, get ready for an experience like no other.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Randomized Rooms</h2><li>Discover a myriad of themed rooms, each with its own set of mechanics and challenge